  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_pal/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">팔라딘상세정보</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;l \n                            </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_necro/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">네크마법상세정보</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ninja/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">닌자상세정보</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_busido/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">무사도상세정보</font></a></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Ninjitsu<img align=\"right\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/logo_nin.gif\" width=\"100\">\n</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">직업 \n                            타이틀: -</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            주 상승 스탯: -</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            부가 상승 스탯: -</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬사용 \n                            : 해당마법사용</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수련 \n                            가능 NPC: Ninja(Makoto마을)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 \n                            Up: 난이도</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:15; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/ninja.gif\" width=\"46\">무사도는 \n                            SE지역 토구노섬의 Makoto 마을NPC에서 배우실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:15; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n                            마법책은 팬댄서도조던전의 입구 근처의 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/S_Ninja/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Elite \n                            Ninja(엘리트닌자)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이라는 \n                            몬스터에게서 획득하실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\" width=\"44\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">표시</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\" width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마나</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\" width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/6.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Backstab</b>: Ninjitsu \n                                        수치와 목표한 타겟으로부터 시전자가 \n                                        위치한 정도에 따라 결정된 추가 데미지가 \n                                        포함된 stealth 공격이라고 할 수 있다. \n                                        </span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/5.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Surprise \n                                        Attack</b> : 잠시 동안 적의 방어력을 약화시키는 \n                                        stealth 공격이다. 단, 시전자는&nbsp; Surprise \n                                        Attack 후에 5초 동안은 stealth 상태에 \n                                        다시 진입할 수 없다. </span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/8.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Mirror \n                                        Image</b> : 분신을 만들어내어 시전자를 향한 \n                                        데미지를 흡수하게 한다. 단, 시전자는 \n                                        분신 주변 4타일 안에 위치해 있어야 한다. \n                                        또한 분신은 Follower 슬롯을 차지하며 \n                                        30~60초 후에는 사라진다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">40</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/7.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Shadow \n                                        Jump</b>: 성공시 stealth상태를 유지하면서 \n                                        목표한 곳으로 텔레포트 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">할 \n                                        수 있다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">15</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/1.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Focus \n                                        Attack</b> : 단 한번의 공격에 대해 무기의 \n                                        공격력과 명중률을 올려준다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">60</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/4.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Ki \n                                        Attack</b> : Ki Attack을 시전하는 장소로부터 \n                                        목표한 적이 얼마나 떨어져 있는지에 따라서 \n                                        데미지가 더 커지게 되는 스킬이다. 시전 \n                                        후 2초 안에는 목표물에 다가서야한다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">25</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">80</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/2.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Death \n                                        Strike</b> : 목표한 적이 Death Strike로 \n                                        공격받게 된 후에 다섯 발자국을 움직이거나 \n                                        혹은 5초가 경과된다면, 적은 시전자의 \n                                        Ninjitsu 수치에 따라 결정된 직접적인 \n                                        데미지를 받게 된다. </span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"26\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">85</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"44\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/ninbu/3.jpg\" width=\"44\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Animal \n                                        Form</b> : 시전자를 특정 형태로 변신시키면서, \n                                        특별한 보너스를 주는 스킬이다. 만약 \n                                        이 스킬을 쓰면서 도주 시에는 자동적으로 \n                                        그전에 마지막으로 선택했던 대상으로 \n                                        변신하게 된다.</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#C9BA93\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"98%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"26\" style=\"mso-height-source:userset;height:20.1pt\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"height:20.1pt;width:73pt\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">동물형태</span></font></p></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"width:26pt\" width=\"35\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬</span></font></p></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" class=\"xl25\" style=\"width:369pt\" width=\"492\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">특수능력</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"26\" style=\"mso-height-source:userset;height:20.1pt\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC33\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"height:20.1pt;width:73pt\" width=\"97\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Rabbit</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"xl24\" style=\"width:26pt\" width=\"35\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">0</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"xl25\" style=\"width:369pt\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20포인트의 stealth 스킬의 증가</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"26\" style=\"mso-height-source:userset;height:20.1pt\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC33\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"height:20.1pt;width:73pt\" width=\"97\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Rat</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"xl24\" style=\"width:26pt\" width=\"35\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">0</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"xl25\" style=\"width:369pt\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20포인트의 stealth 스킬의 증가</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"26\" style=\"mso-height-source:userset;height:20.1pt\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC33\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"height:20.1pt;width:73pt\" width=\"97\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Cat</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"xl24\" style=\"width:26pt\" width=\"35\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">40</span></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"xl25\" style=\"width:369pt\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">regeneration수치 증가.\n</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">증가폭은Ninjitsu스킬에 따라 달라짐.</span></font><span style=\